// The time the engine sees. The window reads no clock here: the engine's time is the clock reading the window opened at plus the seconds the session clock has counted, so a script that ticks the same seconds writes the same log, byte for byte.

// The engine's time for the state, in ms since the epoch.
gym_session_time(World gym_world, Session gym_state) {
  word gym_moment = gym_world.record.origin + gym_state.cells[(import gym_cell_elapsed)] * 1000;
} return word gym_moment;
